  "P0": {
    "strict_goal_closed": false,
    "findings": [
      {
        "topic": "执行 authority",
        "implemented": "verify_core 是 Python verify_program 别名；完整 primitive SSA/resource/CFG 检查后，Interpreter 再验输入，LLVM _verified 再验 bytes，compile 再生成并比对 IR。CLI run/build 实际进入这些消费者。",
        "unclosed": "尚非所有历史 Rust/C/Owned-LLVM 命令的唯一通路；source hash、Rust shadow、producer receipt 不能替代 Core admission，也没有 whole-language soundness/refinement 闭合。",
        "refs": [
          "authority",
          "verifier",
          "python_vm",
          "llvm",
          "cli"
        ]
      },
      {
        "topic": "版本与转换",
        "implemented": "primitive v1–v7；composite.v1→v6、composite.v2→v7 后重验。历史 executable envelope 认证后解码操作并 lower；scalar envelope qualified_for 后转换真实 SSA/PHI/边值。版本升级两侧重验。",
        "unclosed": "raw ResourceIR/HSIR 不是通用可执行导入格式；canonical v6 与 latest v7 保留区别，不能用版本号推断语义。",
        "refs": [
          "schemas",
          "authority",
          "upgrade",
          "verifier"
        ]
      },
      {
        "topic": "旧 IR 职责",
        "implemented": "semantic_ir 为 checked-source snapshot，hsir 为 scalar adapter，ResourceIR 为抽象 owner/loan/place CFG。source backend 部分消费 layout/type 与有限 Drop plan。source frontend 当前生成 v1。",
        "unclosed": "ResourceIR 缺具体 scalar 值语义，不是完整 executable Core；source frontend 拒绝外部代码、tasks、stored reference、float 等。部分 metadata/Drop 消费不证明 source→Core→native refinement。",
        "refs": [
          "semantic",
          "hsir",
          "resource_ir",
          "resource_lowering",
          "drop_plan",
          "frontend"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "P1": {
    "strict_goal_closed": false,
    "findings": [
      {
        "topic": "内存与 provenance",
        "implemented": "封闭类型为有限机器整数/bool/unit 与 buffer/chain/readbuf/mutbuf。检查 owner linearity、root/parent loan identity、冲突借用、子借用暂停；byte access 有 bounds；分配/释放显式。公开 VM/native entry 为 scalar-only。",
        "unclosed": "受限 byte-owner provenance 不是任意 typed heap/raw pointer/unsafe/FFI 的通用模型；native 依赖 LLVM、allocator freshness/disjointness、libc/platform。不能称绝对 Rust-equivalent 安全。",
        "refs": [
          "verifier",
          "python_vm",
          "llvm",
          "normative_doc"
        ]
      },
      {
        "topic": "借用返回",
        "implemented": "局部重借用、stored loans、record-field borrowing 经 structural elaboration 保留 primitive loan 身份；internal calls 可接收非逃逸 view。",
        "unclosed": "primitive 返回 readbuf/mutbuf 显式拒绝；composite 返回任意 has_loans 类型也拒绝。通用逃逸借用返回、自引用 lifetime 系统未实现。",
        "refs": [
          "verifier",
          "composite"
        ]
      },
      {
        "topic": "递归 ADT",
        "implemented": "v7 实现 Nil | Node(buffer,chain)，native node 24 bytes；push 失败返还原 tail/payload，pop 转移所有权，drop 迭代释放；composite.v2 可组合该 primitive。",
        "unclosed": "不是任意 recursive heap ADT/树/图；by-value nominal 递归被拒绝，通用 boxed nominal recursion 未提供。",
        "refs": [
          "llvm",
          "composite",
          "schemas"
        ]
      },
      {
        "topic": "部分初始化",
        "implemented": "旧 ResourceIR 有 initialized-place 集合和 take_field/init_field，检查 moved parent、live loan、double owner。新 Core buffer 为已初始化字节；record.make 要求全部字段；linear record.get 拒绝，unpack 消耗整个 record。",
        "unclosed": "旧抽象 place verifier 不等于 standalone 通用部分初始化内存模型；未见 Core MaybeUninit、任意部分构造对象、placement-new/自定义析构支持。",
        "refs": [
          "resource_ir",
          "composite",
          "python_vm",
          "resource_lowering"
        ]
      },
      {
        "topic": "取消与清理",
        "implemented": "composite task 为显式同步 cooperative state machine；主动 poll，pending/running cancel 消耗 state 一次，completed/cancelled 保持终态。",
        "unclosed": "不提供 background scheduler/channels/preemptive async cancellation；trap/budget stop 不保证 unwind 析构。旧 hosted task/I/O 不能自动计入 standalone Core。",
        "refs": [
          "composite",
          "python_vm",
          "verifier"
        ]
      },
      {
        "topic": "资源上界",
        "implemented": "Python VM 有 step/live-byte/call-depth 限制；0-size→object-size→heap-budget→allocator-attempt/failure 顺序明确。",
        "unclosed": "evaluator 限制不是 native stack-byte、CPU-time、RSS 的通用上界；termination/全程序资源上界证明未闭合。",
        "refs": [
          "python_vm",
          "llvm",
          "normative_doc"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "P2": {
    "strict_goal_closed": false,
    "findings": [
      {
        "topic": "Rust checker/scalar VM",
        "implemented": "--owned-shadow 独立检查有限 owner/loan CFG、resource calls 与 v7 chain transitions；scalar VM 已有 CFG/calls。生产 crosscheck 先用 Python authority。",
        "unclosed": "Rust 未替换生产 admission 或整个 Python compiler；static chain/owner 检查不能算资源运行时完成。",
        "refs": [
          "rust_verify",
          "rust_vm",
          "rust_entry",
          "crosscheck",
          "cli"
        ]
      },
      {
        "topic": "Rust owned VM",
        "implemented": "--owned-run：单函数/单块、scalar entry/results、ret/trap；10资源操作 buffer.new/try_new/len、borrow.read/mut、loan.end、owner.move/drop、buffer.load/store。whole-document verify_owned+whitelist 先于 Machine；完整 owner/loan/heap ledger。",
        "unclosed": "owned execution 拒绝 resource calls、CFG edges、多函数/块、bulk、chain、direct nominal/composite；不是 general resource runtime，也无 Rust native emitter 资格。",
        "refs": [
          "rust_vm",
          "rust_memory",
          "rust_entry"
